# Netlify reads this file for redirects.
#
# The scouting app used to be served from this site at /scout/, before it
# moved to its own subdomain. Anyone with the old link or an old home-screen
# shortcut lands on the real app instead of a stale copy. 301 = permanent.
/scout      https://scouting.bubblotics.ca/          301
/scout/*    https://scouting.bubblotics.ca/:splat    301
